{"id":"mesa","lemma":"mesa","pos":"noun","rank":569,"glosses":["table","dinner table","mesa"],"ipa":"/ˈmesa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mesas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-mesa.wav","formAudio":{"mesas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-mesas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Esto es una mesa.","en":"This is a desk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441093"},{"text":"Ellos no usan sillas ni mesas.","en":"They don't use chairs or tables.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527260"},{"text":"Siéntate a la mesa.","en":"Sit at the table.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443024"},{"text":"No hay mesas en la habitación.","en":"There are no tables in the room."},{"text":"Ven a la mesa.","en":"Come to the table.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/731806"}]}